# Build output
#
# One output root, out/<Platform>/<Configuration>/, pinned in the .vcxproj.
# The bare x64/, Debug/ and Release/ below are the OLD locations, kept ignored
# so a tree built before the move does not show its leftovers as untracked.
out/
x64
Debug
Release

# IDE / tooling caches
#
# The whole of .vs\, rather than the file names it happened to contain. The
# old list named one FileContentIndex .vsidx by its guid, and Visual Studio
# writes a new guid whenever it reindexes -- so the next one showed up
# untracked, along with the v17\ipch\ precompiled headers the list never
# mentioned at all.
.vs/
.understand-anything/
*.vcxproj.user
*.aps
